@startuml 2.2.11_L2
title L2 – Components & Access
actor LO as "Logistics Operator"
participant UI as "SPA"
participant API as "PortOps API"
participant RB as "RBAC"
database DB as "DB"
queue AUD as "Audit Log"

LO -> UI : Manage staff
UI -> API : POST/PATCH/GET ... + JWT
API -> RB : Check role(LOGISTICS_OPERATOR)
RB --> API : Allowed
API -> DB : CRUD Staff (+ StaffQualifications)
DB --> API : OK / Conflicts / NotFound
API --> AUD : Append audit entry (async)
API --> UI : 2xx/4xx
UI --> LO : Show results
@enduml
